OL,3,GNEWSANo trace of missing fishing boat
OL,4,Afound in search off Lewis
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo trace of a missing fishing boat has
OL,7,Fbeen found at two sites, off the north
OL,8,Fof the Isle of Lewis, that experts had
OL,9,Fidentified for further investigation.
OL,11,FThree men were on board the Kilda when
OL,12,Fit disappeared on 13 October.
OL,14,FThe body of crew member Douglas Craigie
OL,15,Fwas found by search teams the following
OL,16,Fday but two other men - Norman Murray
OL,17,Fand Murdo Morrison - remain unaccounted
OL,18,Ffor.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
