OL,3,GNEWSANo trace of missing fishing boat
OL,4,Afound in search off Lewis
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Lighthouse Board vessel the
OL,7,FNLV Pharos had identified the sites,
OL,8,Fand they were investigated by the
OL,9,FMarine Accident Investigation Branch
OL,10,F(MAIB) with assistance from fish farm
OL,11,Fcompany Mowi.
